OL,3,GNEWSAHotel expansion set for approval
OL,4,Adespite horse fall fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand a country house hotel
OL,7,Fin southern Scotland have been
OL,8,Frecommended for approval despite fears
OL,9,Fthey could increase risks for horse
OL,10,Friders nearby.
OL,12,FThe RAD Hotel Group wants to extend its
OL,13,FHetland Hall Hotel near Carrutherstown,
OL,14,Fcreating up to 60 jobs.
OL,16,FA nearby landowner has objected due to
OL,17,Fconcerns that visitors to the proposed
OL,18,Flodges might bring dogs which could
OL,19,Fspook horses.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
